int","coordinates":[136.8993604,35.12439061]}}],"display_comment_original":"名古屋市には、地域の由緒を示す案内板や石碑を探す余地がある。 この地域には史跡や遺跡、寺社や信仰の場、古墳や貝塚に関わる場所が見え、宮宿白本陣跡、宮宿赤本陣跡、熱田大宮司宅跡のような地点が探索の入口になる。 現地では史跡説明板が手がかりになりそうだ。さらに水辺の由緒を示す歴史案内板も見つかるかもしれない。","story_enrichment":{"samurai_priority_people":["織田信長"],"notable_people":["織田信長"],"honorary_citizens":[],"tourism_landmarks":["猪子石城","上野城","大高城","大森城","上社城","川名北城","川名南城","吉根城"],"specialties":["あんかけスパゲッティ","イタリアンスパゲッティ","外郎（ういろう、ないろ）","卯十郎金時","小倉トースト","きしめん"],"food_culture":[],"historical_domains":["名古屋藩"],"heian_place_names":[],"japan_search_support":["織田信長書状 https://jpsearch.go.jp/item/NagoyaCity_Museum-200_0001_00007_0000","織田信長判物･織田信雄判物 https://jpsearch.go.jp/item/NagoyaCity_Museum-512_0007_00000_0000","織田信長黒印状 https://jpsearch.go.jp/item/NagoyaCity_Museum-516_0045_00000_0000"],"enrichment_sources":["https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%90%8D%E5%8F%A4%E5%B1%8B%E5%B8%82","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q171411","https://jpsearch.go.jp/csearch/jps-cross?csid=jps-cross&keyword=%E7%B9%94%E7%94%B0%E4%BF%A1%E9%95%B7&keyword=%E5%90%8D%E5%8F%A4%E5%B1%8B%E5%B8%82"],"enrichment_errors":[],"wikipedia_title":"名古屋市","wikipedia_revision_id":"110865685","wikidata_qid":"Q11751","wikipedia_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%90%8D%E5%8F%A4%E5%B1%8B%E5%B8%82","japan_search_query_url":"https://jpsearch.go.jp/csearch/jps-cross?csid=jps-cross&keyword=%E7%B9%94%E7%94%B0%E4%BF%A1%E9%95%B7&keyword=%E5%90%8D%E5%8F%A4%E5%B1%8B%E5%B8%82","status":"wikipedia_ok"}}